{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_area_ring","model_identifier":"spell_area_ring","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_area_ring\n\nBattle-mage area ring: a flat glowing ring on the ground, radius 32 u (1.8 m) at scale 1; the game expands it for the area blast.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -34..34, y 0..1, z -34..34 units (1.91 x 0.03 x 1.91 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 48.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 68 x 1 x 68 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ring0, glow_ring1, glow_ring10, glow_ring11, glow_ring12, glow_ring13, glow_ring14, glow_ring15, glow_ring16, glow_ring17, glow_ring18, glow_ring19 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_ring0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[30.0,0.0,-4.5],"to":[34.0,1.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10.0,10.0,14.0,11.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.5,10.0,9.5,11.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10.0,10.0,14.0,11.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.5,10.0,9.5,11.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,4.0,9.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.5,4.0,9.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d3343495-ce57-5015-968e-7ea2ef681d40"},{"name":"glow_ring1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[30.0,0.