aa7a0-379f-514f-aa0b-fa0b87d92d97","73ceefd0-f3d9-5bf4-8860-2878d2c54d02","81dd3927-efdb-5012-96d9-00ed5230c4f4","c88e2c58-b3fb-5027-83d2-5a3f78322b67","d282066a-96b7-51b1-a77e-097769d2d927","af5c5512-e466-5e8d-9e73-cdf8d0dbaf70","cc61d1e5-deff-5f5f-8cfa-224882a6a49b","95d31ee9-0e46-57ff-989d-efd5801a38ad","e3c6b878-f174-552e-8886-2bc55a4fad46","ae5997be-fb3a-5796-96af-b9e971f1c218","7f320a01-d264-5d72-9f7e-77b534eb1af5","a950c1b6-d301-5dfd-824b-adc78c73ef14","fc1960c2-5c0f-5ba6-b17f-f6b49d5d0715","416ca698-6cff-5798-9394-6f65fcacd4f5"]}],"textures":[{"path":"spell_area_ring.png","name":"spell_area_ring.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":16,"height":16,"uv_width":16,"uv_height":16,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"c9399562-7979-56da-90b2-9c6aa654cf1a","relative_path":"spell_area_ring.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABAAAAAQCAYAAAAf8/9hAAAAPklEQVR4nGOcFfPhPwMSCO3gZyAFMJGkGgtgwSUhKMPISBcXjBqAJRaIDX2quYARPSUSC9KWCJDk0lGABwAAf6wISKBTtYUAAAAASUVORK5CYII="}],"animations":[],"description":"# spell_area_ring\n\nBattle-mage area ring: a flat glowing ring on the ground, radius 32 u (1.8 m) at scale 1; the game expands it for the area blast.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -34..34, y 0..1, z -34..34 units (1.91 x 0.03 x 1.91 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 48.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 68 x 1 x 68 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ring0, glow_ring1, glow_ring10, glow_ring11, glow_ring12, glow_ring13, glow_ring14, glow_ring15, glow_ring16, glow_ring17, glow_ring18, glow_ring19 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"}